flowchart TB
  USER[User / Founder] --> UI[ORBIT Workspace]
  UI --> API[ORBIT Core API]
  API --> IAM[Identity, Workspace, Device Policy]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL: Tasks, Audit, Artifacts)]
  API --> WF[Durable Workflow Engine Adapter]
  WF --> AG[ORBIT Agent Runtime]
  AG --> MR[Model Gateway / Provider Router]
  AG --> PG[Policy Tool Gateway]
  PG --> WEB[BrowserDriver: Playwright / Optional CLI]
  PG --> CODE[SandboxProvider: Docker / OpenSandbox / Alternative]
  PG --> DESK[Desktop Session Broker]
  PG --> ACP[AgentBackend: ACP / External Agents]
  PG --> SKILL[Skill Registry + Runtime]
  AG --> UIX[Validated UISpec Catalog]
  DESK <-->|Outbound WSS leases| NODE[Local Desktop Node]
  NODE --> NATIVE[Native OS Accessibility Driver]
  API --> OTEL[OpenTelemetry Export]
  API --> SBOM[Supply-chain & License Release Gate]
